@title Ask Claude: the agree box stays off until the notice has been scrolled into view
@area Assistant
@sizes 1366x600
# On a short window the notice (section 4) is below the fold: the box cannot be ticked until it has been in view.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text ask claude
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Scroll down and read"
expect_disabled "I have read this and agree"
expect_disabled "Turn Claude on"
shot ask-claude-agree-gate-off
scroll 250 300 -3000
wait 6
expect "4. Agree"
expect_enabled "I have read this and agree"
shot ask-claude-agree-gate-on
check_layout
